{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》的一眾演員16日齊集銅鑼灣出席宣傳活動，場面十分熱鬧。在劇中以「大小姐」龍力蓮一角深入民心的林淑敏（Mandy），戲內性格巴辣、氣場強大，戲外卻以溫柔與寵粉著稱。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">活動當日，林淑敏收起螢幕前的霸氣，以一身充滿「反差萌」的休閒造型現身。她身穿櫻桃圖案的白色恤衫，搭配牛仔褲及黑色粗框眼鏡，妝容亦以淡妝示人，即便如此，她皮膚依然白皙透亮且雙頰紅潤。面對鏡頭時，她不時甜笑並做出心形手勢，展現出毫無明星架子的一面。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a259a62a-4298-4f82-b226-32832f32771b.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026nTy0xGkKWo1784282183.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a259a62a-4298-4f82-b226-32832f32771b.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"045014c7-cbb6-40e5-a79c-e53570caa9a8.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026hgRWaH54911784282192.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"045014c7-cbb6-40e5-a79c-e53570caa9a8.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">《愛回家之開心速遞》鐵粉問答比賽﹕</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://tvb.app.do/quiz_chl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">https://tvb.app.do/quiz_chl</span></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">活動結束後，有幸運粉絲在社交平台分享與林淑敏的絕密合照與影片。林淑敏一見到前來支持的粉絲，便隨即展現燦爛笑容，並主動伸出雙臂給予熱情的問候，此舉令在場支持者大感貼心與感動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">該名與林淑敏深度交流的粉絲事後難掩興奮，於社交平台上發佈長文深情告白：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「好多謝淑敏🥹🫶🏻琴日同你見面互動and傾計影相真係好開心❤️你真係好sweet同埋多謝你咁錫我🥹🫂我好鍾意你琴日戴眼鏡呢個造型,好得意🤭🫶🏻點解化咁淡嘅妝都可以咁靚女😭🫶🏻希望你鍾意我送畀你啲禮物laa💝返去一定要好好休息and聽我講早啲瞓!! 我一定會好好珍惜我琴日影嘅相同埋拍嘅所有片🫶🏻同埋我一定會保守住你同我講嘅秘密hehe🤭🫂i love uu even more now after ytd!!❤️muah muah muah🫶🏻🫶🏻🫶🏻」字裡行間可見，林淑敏不僅耐心地與粉絲聊天拍照，更像朋友一樣與對方相處，相當貼地。</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T13:18:34.462820+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":655,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}